  (text "POWER FLAGS (ERC)" (at 22.86 293.25 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid a6b42783-52fe-5273-ab8a-bd43de40f447)
  )
  (text "NOTES" (at 20.32 308.49 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 906a6c21-5c43-579f-bdd8-9156c8ab384b)
  )
  (text "1. TBD values: calculate from the LM5176 and TPS54560B datasheets (Detailed Design sections) or TI WEBENCH before layout."
    (at 20.32 312.3 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 3d182e76-e361-5df9-bf0f-df0df237fbaa)
  )
  (text "2. FB dividers R25/R26 and R31/R32 assume a 0.8 V reference. Verify against the TPS54560B datasheet."
    (at 20.32 316.11 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 4b7ac216-ac87-5dc4-b8bf-050aa17c4869)
  )
  (text "3. AGND and PGND share the GND net. Join them under U2's thermal pad and keep each power loop compact."
    (at 20.32 319.92 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid a83df39c-59e4-55f1-aefb-e936a8a3fb57)
  )
  (text "4. R1 is a 4-terminal shunt. Route ISNS_P / ISNS_N as a tight Kelvin pair from R1's sense pads to U1."
    (at 20.32 323.73 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 60bdaffa-2129-59c4-86f8-1e72200a4e51)
  )
  (text "5. Check J1/J2/J3 pad 1 = + against the AMASS drawing before ordering."
    (at 20.32 327.54 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid c4c0ae1e-6dbe-5c98-bcf0-cca44ad52d9a)
  )
  (text "6. Scale factors for the FC: FC_CURR_SNS = 25 mV/A (40 A/V), FC_VBAT_SNS = VBAT / 11."
    (at 20.32 331.35 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 3a51905d-63c5-5729-9783-b86a7590e1e3)
  )

